  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "XP Deus <a href=\"@sand-scoops-for-metal-detecting/\" data-kind=\"internal\">Anderson Carbon Straight Shaft</a> So Here we go upgraded to the <a href=\"@sand-scoops-for-metal-detecting/\" data-kind=\"internal\">Anderson Carbon detector shaft</a>, For the XP DEUS, and what a great addition, much better if your Taller, much sturdier and with the holder for the remote attached, gives this detector a whole new feel, only drawback is the remote holder is ok appart from.... the fitting of it, it seems as though Anderson got to that part couldnt decide how to finish it, said that'll do and rushed it out, a little more thought to that one little thing and the shaft would be complete.. <a href=\"http://bit.ly/2W9RTBX\" data-kind=\"affiliate\">video in use will be coming soon</a>"
  },
